				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ttgqy7ayajurv3rp3qtyjzy4/bafkreic7jpc7wzbia6dofbq362kscpwasaboigh6dka7y4yktkvjc5ntjm"
			},
			"date": "2025-12-03T22:29:28.120Z",
			"content": "<p>So rather than pay the speakers for their expertise and work building the talks you offer them the chance of a job if they impress? This rather feels like paying the band with exposure.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3m74j6m3sys2v",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:ttgqy7ayajurv3rp3qtyjzy4/app.bsky.feed.post/3m74izgvpq227",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3m74j6m3sys2v",
