			"date": "2025-12-03T22:49:11.650Z",
			"content": "<p>Fair enough and good to know, but then isn't the conference itself the paid gig? As a recruitment fair it would be rather imbalanced? Why pay to attend/sponsor a showcase (and possible auction)?<br>\nIt is an interesting idea though!</p>",
